  "description": "1000W Brushless Motor\n\nThe Lankeleisi XT750PLUS features a 48V 1000W rear-mounted brushless motor, providing smooth acceleration up to 25 km/h, making it perfect for riding on various terrains.\n\n48V 17.5Ah Li-ion Battery\n\nThe Lankeleisi XT750 PLUS is equipped with a high-capacity 840Wh removable Li-ion battery, offering a range of up to 120 km in pedal-assist mode and 60 km in pure-electric mode, making it ideal for daily commuting.\n\nFull Suspension\n\nThe Lankeleisi XT750 PLUS features a full suspension system with front fork and rear shock absorbers that efficiently absorb impacts from rough terrain, including rocks, roots, and uneven surfaces. This setup ensures a smoother, more controlled ride, allowing riders to tackle any terrain comfortably. Take the X3000Plus-up and conquer whatever lies ahead.\n\nLCD Color Display\n\nColour Backlight Display to keep track of speed, mileage, power and more.",
